// [DRAFT] D718, D726 — the sand dervish Kesh: the Warden of Balance's path, no god
say|OATH_DERVISH|I pray neither to Samal nor to his neighbours. Sand serves nobody. Only balance.
say|OATH_DERVISH|Whoever walks with no god is a Warden of Balance: steadfastness, a shield and a calm hand. Expect no blessing, only your own feet.
say|OATH_DERVISH|The path is chosen at the gate, with the scribe. I only whirl.
exit|
